  "kv13.9:1.1": "Dhammataṇhā abyākatā ti? ",
  "kv13.9:1.2": "Āmantā. ",
  "kv13.9:1.3": "Vipākābyākatā kiriyābyākatā rūpaṃ nibbānaṃ cakkhāyatanaṃ --pe-- ",
  "kv13.9:1.4": "phoṭṭhabbāyatanan ti? ",
  "kv13.9:1.5": "Na h' evaṃ vattabbe --pe-- ",
